{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0033_1000_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7de2ee6ec96682af64d7ced6e692c339c60b175939cb6bd353dec0f3681bb998", "ja": "あの、{$P$}。\nちょっとお願いがあるんですけど、いいですか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}。\n我有件事想拜托你，可以打扰一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0033_1001_p", "source_sha256": "119a4ff218ec87adf77766989a753a57adaa2de953ce245c8bc8b3b3bf65235c", "ja": "雪歩か。\nそんなにかしこまって、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "是雪步啊。\n看你一副正经八百的模样，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0033_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8e70fc068a17d959f30ec54b97c142bc56f0a54662ca496f9bc431efa1560751", "ja": "はい……。今度のお仕事の台本なんですけど、\nさ、先に読んでもらえませんか……？", "zh": "是……关于下次工作的剧本，\n可、可以先帮我读过一次吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0033_1003_p", "source_sha256": "99f50d41f0d096804580fe8315787e88f37307b5a3843579edfd6c5998161ef4", "ja": "先にって、俺が？", "zh": "读过一次？我来读吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0033_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "beb80f13b81d08f0d24d238ed9e47af2902bbe419bd57293c5153233ff07dceb", "ja": "私、このお話の元になった絵本を持ってるんです。\nでも、小さいころに読んで、怖くなっちゃって……。", "zh": "其实我有这个故事的原作绘本。\n但是我小时候读过之后，就很害怕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0033_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8639b0ce65b9c49f89b7cdf1ea9c58a00c81eacf49fe8d2dd954fbd713c8b644", "ja": "もしかしたら、この台本も怖いお話なのかなって思い\nながら読んでると、ぜんぜん頭に入って来なくて……。", "zh": "只要一想到这篇剧本可能也是个可怕的故事，\n就完全没办法把剧本记到脑海里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0033_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "115854f8583db065314b0d7d38ce0c5801702efebaad3365cf2516021a0111b0", "ja": "だから、心の準備をさせてほしいんですぅ！", "zh": "所以，想请你帮我做好心理准备！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0033_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2397fbc59b5495a28536532f5b9e51e2e228ffb26d4627578783e365ef76d116", "ja": "な、なるほど。でも大丈夫だよ。台本はもう目を通した\nけど、怖いシーンなんてなかったから。", "zh": "原、原来是这样。但是没问题啦，\n剧本我已经看过了，里面没有任何恐怖场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0033_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e9906169c43718b47f62c52546caca8581cb9bd47b7d3e014bb7921973b8ac3f", "ja": "ほ、本当ですか？　よかったぁ……。\n{$P$}、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "真、真的吗？太好了……\n{$P$}，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0033_1009_p", "source_sha256": "61fe0de1e50b0b933580b4dd82df6941926123ef6048069a38c2c8c6333ab0f6", "ja": "ああ。毒リンゴを食べてしまったお姫様を、王子様が\nキスで起こすなんて、ロマンチックなお話だし……。", "zh": "嗯，而且这是误吃毒苹果的公主\n被王子用吻唤醒的浪漫故事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0033_1010_p", "source_sha256": "e7b1af711137b08cd1d4cd927f4d3d97b3d54017d57d3db2e9913c922a770402", "ja": "稽古が楽しみだな、雪歩！", "zh": "真期待排练呢，雪步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0033_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b50b2d6f7647a9d1de0728a1b852edea20a43257caecc3bfca8294d69ffcdd0a", "ja": "えへへ、そうですね。\nロマンチックなお話で、お姫様を……王子様が……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，是呀。\n是个浪漫的故事，而且公主……被王子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0033_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "fd3e37d70a8a982f7292e37d17ca883d3c56978f86779141e08db2d0b7076644", "ja": "キスぅ！？　そんな私、きき、キスだなんて……！\n無理です、絶対無理ですぅ～～っ！！？", "zh": "吻！？怎么会，接接、接吻什么的……！\n没办法，我绝对没办法啦～～！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0033_1013_p", "source_sha256": "9358e84964c4a84b9d42f87bab5da91b39b2725969db670c78219fb079bfa268", "ja": "えっ！？　あっ、そうだった！　待ってくれ雪歩、\nキスといってもフリだけだし、それに……！", "zh": "咦！？啊，对喔！雪步你等等，\n虽说是接吻，也只是做做样子而已，而且……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0033_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "24f889883009ce0f83f3f96210beb69a69542bcfe9ccf215dab30b91d659dcea", "ja": "男の人に近づくのだって、{$P$}で\nやっと慣れてきたくらいなのに……ぐすっ。", "zh": "就连靠近男生这回事，也是在遇见\n{$P$}后才渐渐习惯的说……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0033_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9a91646d6d979414666501c11554f473c395516ab7e9674e926f20366c4710c6", "ja": "と、とにかく、キスなんて私にはできません～！\nううっ、失礼しますぅ～！", "zh": "总、总而言之，接吻什么的我办不到～！\n呜呜，我先失陪了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0033_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9408152d70e3fec3ce9e718aec79b7d73097dc2c1be1a61b2520ab89469e9f15", "ja": "（行ってしまったか。王子様役も女の子だってことは、\n伝えたら解決に……なるのか？）", "zh": "（走掉了啊。只要告诉她演王子的人也是女生，\n就能解决了……吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
